  "title": "SMB Underwriting Data: The Key to Scalable Lending Operations",
  "summary": "SMB underwriting data is the structured and unstructured information—bank transactions, credit bureau records, accounting data, identity verification, and behavioral signals—that lenders use to assess whether a small or medium-sized business qualifies for financing. This data powers every core lending decision: who gets approved, at what terms, and how fast.",
